@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Simulated terminals (demo mode only)
GET {{api}}/simulator/terminals

### Card number and expiry of the first demo customer (demo mode only)
# @name card
GET {{api}}/simulator/demo-card

### 0800 echo test through the switch (mutual TLS)
POST {{api}}/simulator/card-network
Content-Type: application/json

{ "operation": "ECHO", "terminal": "ATM" }

### 0200 balance inquiry: the PIN block is encrypted under the acquirer zone key
POST {{api}}/simulator/card-network
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "BALANCE",
  "terminal": "ATM",
  "pan": "{{card.response.body.data.pan}}",
  "expiry": "{{card.response.body.data.expiry}}",
  "pin": "4826"
}

### 0200 cash withdrawal of Rs 500
POST {{api}}/simulator/card-network
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "WITHDRAWAL",
  "terminal": "ATM",
  "pan": "{{card.response.body.data.pan}}",
  "expiry": "{{card.response.body.data.expiry}}",
  "pin": "4826",
  "amount": 50000
}
